\end_inset

:
 Is an abelian group with 0 as identity element.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Description
\begin_inset Formula $\boldsymbol{\mathbb{C},+}$
\end_inset

:
 Is an abelian group with 
\begin_inset Formula $0+\imath0$
